# The Death of Gwen Stacy {2}{B} Saga. I: destroy target creature (Bot1's own Memnite). II (turn 3): each player may discard a card and each
# who doesn't loses 3 life (CR 101.4, 608.2c): Bot1 discards a Swamp and loses nothing, Bot2 declines and goes to 17. III (turn 5): any
# number of target players' graveyards are exiled (CR 115.1d, 406.2): both of them here, so Bot1's Black Lotus, Memnite and Swamp
# leave, and the Saga, sacrificed after III (CR 714.4), is all that is left in Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
The Death of Gwen Stacy
Swamp x4
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.The Death of Gwen Stacy.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Black Lotus
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Swamp; Swamp)
Bot1.Choose(Swamp)
Bot2.Choose()
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Target(Bot1; Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard = The Death of Gwen Stacy
